      "text": "- the BEST\n    - always reload the data as often as you can\n      - definitely if you mutate the resource\n\n- do timers\n    - this is called polling\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- the BEST\n    - always reload the data as often as you can\n      - definitely if you mutate the resource\n\n- do timers\n    - this is called polling\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
