      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790195334862,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Optimistic or Pessimistic \n\n    - optimistic\n        add something, lie and and it to the list (as pending)\n\n        if there is an error, fess up to your lie and remove it.\n\n    - pessimistic\n        - kind of what we are doing - not showing it to you\n          until it is *really* there.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Optimistic or Pessimistic \n\n    - optimistic\n        add something, lie and and it to the list (as pending)\n\n        if there is an error, fess up to your lie and remove it.\n\n    - pessimistic\n        - kind of what we are doing - not showing it to you\n          until it is *really* there.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
